## Roadmap for Next Phases

- **Phase 2**: Database Migration, Seed Script (Admin, Manager, Member test users), Prisma Client setup.
- **Phase 3**: Authentication (Register, Login, Session handling with secure HttpOnly cookies) & RBAC middleware.
- **Phase 4**: Task Management Engine (CRUD API routes, Server Actions/DTOs with Zod validation, Activity logging).
- **Phase 5**: UI Components & Dashboard (Enterprise navigation, metric cards, Task list with filters/search, Kanban Board).
- **Phase 6**: Collaboration Features (Task detail drawer/page, Comment system, real-time activity feed).
- **Phase 7**: End-to-End Verification, Security Audit against `Starter.md`, Documentation polish, Deployment readiness.

